9. Risks and Mitigations
Potential Risks:
High I/O operations with JSON files could slow down the system.
Multithreading complexities may introduce bugs during concurrent domain checks.
Mitigations:
Optimize JSON read/write operations and consider caching.
Conduct thorough testing for concurrency issues, implementing error logging for debugging.
